# Generated by `tauri android init` / `tauri ios init`. Deliberately not
# committed: the generated Gradle and Xcode projects bake in SDK versions and
# absolute toolchain paths from the machine that produced them, so a checked-in
# copy is wrong everywhere else. `widget/mobile.sh <platform> init` regenerates.
